    "sourceUrl": "https://www.techpowerup.com/354457/thermal-grizzly-releases-new-phasesheet-ptm-pro-with-improved-thermal-conductivity",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-04",
    "summary": "With PhaseSheet PTM Pro, Thermal Grizzly introduces a further development of PhaseSheet PTM with increased thermal conductivity. A composition optimized for improved thermal conductivity, combined with a new carrier film, also makes PhaseSheet PTM Pro easier to handle. The PhaseSheet PTM Pro is a thermal sheet based on a phase change material (PCM). The sheets, which are solid at room temperature, can be easily applied and liquefy during operation, allowing them to effectively dissipate heat like a thermal paste.",
